<title>HONG KONG: Egana Int'l 1996 net rises 12.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Egana Int'l 1996 net rises 12.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   9.2	  vs  8.2 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  3.8 (see note)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  32.09 gain vs  30.86 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    121.38     vs  107.58</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,316.17   vs  1,266.08</p>
<p>    Company name		 Egana International (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 19-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Egana International is a quartz watch distributor.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one-for-one share held. Bonus issue payable on July 7.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on realising its portfolio investment in Peace Mark (Holdings) Ltd and legal interest on compensation.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings has been adjusted due to scrip dividend effect.  </p>
<p>Comparative final dividend of 3.8 H.K. cents per share (distribution of Peace Mark shares in lieu of final dividend).</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 1.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.5 cents) vs 20.3 cents (including interim dividend of 1.6 cents and special dividend of 15 cents).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
